[
  {
    "id": 6003001000110010,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー！　見ててくれたっ？",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "003",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00009",
    "bgm": "002",
    "voice": "produce_communication_televisions/600300100011/6003001000110010"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001000110020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたしテレビに出ちゃったんだよ！？\r\nすごいよねっ、夢みたい！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communication_televisions/600300100011/6003001000110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん\r\nめぐるの晴れ舞台、しっかり見てたよ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001000110030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへー、嬉しいなぁ！\r\n……あっ、そうだ！　友達にも連絡しなくちゃ！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communication_televisions/600300100011/6003001000110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "みんなきっと喜んでくれると思うぞ",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もっともっとテレビに出られるようになって\r\nたくさん観てもらわないとな",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001000110040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！　でもそうなったら、\r\n毎日連絡で大忙しになっちゃうねぇ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communication_televisions/600300100011/6003001000110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "出演の度に、友達みんなに連絡するつもりか……？",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001000110050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そうだよ？　あ、でも、いっぱい出るようになったら\r\nさすがに迷惑かなぁ……？　どうだろう……？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communication_televisions/600300100011/6003001000110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、先のことはともかく。今日のところは頑張ったんだ、\r\nみんなにしっかり報告しておけばいい",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 6003001000110060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うんっ！\r\nそうするね！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_communication_televisions/600300100011/6003001000110060"
  },
